The docstring says *"Follow-up count = filed-issues lines + fix-applier deferrals"*, and `renderFollowupIssues` only counts lines that start with `filed\t`, `unfiled\t`, or `http`. But `deriveRecapScalars` counts *every* non-empty line in `filedIssuesRaw`:
